        "dosageInstruction": [
          {
            "text": "Take one tablet by mouth each morning. Take away from tea, coffee, and dairy where possible; may take with a small amount of food if gastrointestinal upset occurs. If daily dosing is poorly tolerated, may trial alternate-day dosing and inform the clinician. Plan to continue for at least 3 months after haemoglobin normalises, then a further 3 months to replenish stores; total approximately 3–6 months depending on results.",
